    "body": "An alternative would be something like:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nclass MyCustomElement {\r\n  static form = true;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSimilar to `formAssociated`. Then `elementInternals` could be used to configure form behaviour.",
